Subject: [M152] Fix bugs in HTMLMediaElement::SelectNextSourceChild

Original change's description:
> Fix bugs in HTMLMediaElement::SelectNextSourceChild
>
> In SelectNextSourceChild, src_value was held across MediaQueryMatches().
> That call can trigger a style and layout update in an embedding
> document, synchronizing dirty style attributes and causing the element's
> attribute buffer to reallocate.
>
> Fixed: 567447106
> Change-Id: I7a5b13183f65710937d57b6298165bdd0c2f0841
> Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8494613
> Commit-Queue: Benjamin Keen <bkeen@google.com>
> Auto-Submit: Dale Curtis <dalecurtis@chromium.org>
> Commit-Queue: Dale Curtis <dalecurtis@chromium.org>
> Reviewed-by: Benjamin Keen <bkeen@google.com>
